sequenceDiagram
    participant LLM
    participant Host as Host application
    participant A as Instance A
    participant B as Instance B
    participant Store as Shared store

    LLM->>Host: start_burn_analysis(bbox, fire_date)
    Host->>A: tools/call
    A->>Store: Save the job under ana_7f3c
    A-->>Host: analysis_id ana_7f3c, status queued
    Host->>LLM: Observation with the handle

    Note over Host,B: The next call can land on another instance.
    LLM->>Host: get_burn_analysis(analysis_id="ana_7f3c")
    Host->>B: tools/call
    B->>Store: Load ana_7f3c
    Store-->>B: Status done, dNBR statistics
    B-->>Host: Result
    Host->>LLM: Observation
